# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on Keep a Changelog and this project adheres to semantic versioning principles.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-09-28

### Added
- professional portfolio landing page and personal branding structure
- multilingual support with English and Arabic options
- dark/light theme toggle and system preference handling
- Open Graph and social metadata configuration
- Netlify deployment configuration
- custom domain support via `CNAME`
- documentation for about, skills, and release notes
- repository-level quality improvements for professional presentation

### Updated
- production environment URLs aligned to custom domain ownership
- README improved for developer onboarding and portfolio presentation

### Notes
- This release represents the initial professional portfolio version for personal brand and client acquisition.
